<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT NETHERLANDS 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT NETHERLANDS 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Netherlands 2-1 (halftime 0-1) in a friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - Robert Pires 74, Patrice Loko 84</p>
<p>Netherlands - Dennis Bergkamp 3</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,331</p>
